sentences.text:
Award of Rs.65,000/-
towards 'pain and suffering'; Rs.16,000/- towards attendant, food and conveyance charges for in-patient treatment for 32 days; Rs.24,000/- towards loss of income during laid up period;
Rs.25,000/- towards loss of amenities was also on lower side; and even assessment of monthly income of claimant was improper.

Consequently, following:
ORDER i. Appeal is allowed in part;
ii. Judgment and award dated 13.08.2019 passed by II Additional Senior Civil Judge and MACT, Kalaburagi, in MVC no.440/2018 is modified.

